{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16729","headline":"秦越人洞中咏 · 于鹄","name":"秦越人洞中咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扁鹊得仙处，传是西南峰。\n年年山下人，长见骑白龙。\n洞门黑无底，日夜唯雷风。\n清斋将入时，戴星兼抱松。\n石径阴且寒，地响知远钟。\n似行山林外，闻叶履声重。\n低碍更俯身，渐远昼夜同。\n时时白蝙蝠，飞入茅衣中。\n行久路转窄，静闻水淙淙。\n但愿逢一人，自得朝天宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16729.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16729","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}